---
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
---
<Content title="Keycode" description="Four notes. Six guesses. A daily melody puzzle for every kind of ear.">
<div class="keycode">
<div class="game-top"><a href="https://notebrewer.com/play/">← play</a><span id="day"></span></div>
<div class="title-row"><h1>keycode<span>.</span></h1><span class="edition">DAILY MELODY</span></div>
<p class="lead">Four notes. Six guesses. Find your way by ear or by logic.</p>
<div class="listen-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">TODAY’S SECRET</span><div class="secret" aria-hidden="true">♪ &nbsp; ♪ &nbsp; ♪ &nbsp; ♪</div></div><button id="listen" class="primary">▶ Listen</button></div>
<div class="board" id="board" aria-label="Guess history"></div>
<div class="legend"><span><i class="exact">✓</i> Right place</span><span><i class="present">↔</i> Other place</span><span><i class="absent">×</i> Not used</span></div>
<div id="result" hidden><h2 id="result-title"></h2><p id="result-copy"></p><div class="actions"><button id="celebrate">♫ Play the arrangement</button><button id="share">Copy result</button></div><textarea id="share-text" aria-label="Your shareable result" readonly hidden></textarea></div>
<div class="composer" id="composer"><div class="keyboard-top"><span id="prompt">Build your first guess</span><label><input id="names" type="checkbox"/> Note names</label></div><div class="keys" id="keys"></div><div class="range"><span>LOWER</span><span>HIGHER</span></div><div class="actions"><button id="erase" aria-label="Remove last note">⌫ Delete</button><button id="compare">▶ Compare</button><button id="submit" class="primary">Check guess ↵</button></div></div>
<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Tap any note to hear it and add it to your guess.</p>
<div class="hints"><button id="hint">Need a clue?</button><p id="hint-copy" hidden></p></div>
<details><summary>How to play</summary><p>Listen to the secret, then tap four different notes to build a guess. Check it to see which notes belong. You don’t need to know their names: the numbers run from low to high.</p><p><strong>✓</strong> means the note is in the right place. <strong>↔</strong> means it belongs somewhere else. <strong>×</strong> means it isn’t in the melody. Tap a tile in your current row to replace it. Compare plays the secret, then your guess.</p><p>Everyone gets the same puzzle each day, changing at midnight UTC. Progress saves in this browser. Optional clues reveal the melody’s direction, then give higher/lower guidance for your latest guess. No timer. Take your time.</p><p>Keyboard: A S D F G H J K L ; ' ] play notes 1–12. Backspace deletes; Enter checks.</p></details>
</div>
</Content>
<script>import '../scripts/keycode';</script>
<style is:global>
body:has(.keycode) main{max-width:680px;padding-top:26px}.keycode{--ink:#252525;--accent:#334fdb;--line:#dededb}.game-top,.title-row,.keyboard-top,.range{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.game-top{font-size:13px;color:#6a6a67;margin-bottom:30px}.game-top a{text-decoration:none}.title-row h1{font-size:56px;letter-spacing:-4px;margin:0}.title-row h1 span{color:var(--accent)}.edition{font-size:12px;max-width:105px;line-height:1.7;color:#73736f}.lead{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;margin:12px 0 25px}.keycode button{font:inherit;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-radius:5px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;touch-action:manipulation}.keycode button:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}.keycode button:disabled{opacity:.42;cursor:default}.keycode button.primary{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}.keycode button.primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#283fb6;border-color:#283fb6;color:#fff}.listen-panel{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:19px 22px;background:#eeeefa;border:1px solid #e0e1f3;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:24px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.3px;color:#555773}.secret{font-size:26px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:8px}.board{display:grid;gap:7px;width:min(100%,330px);margin:auto}.guess-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.keycode .tile{height:55px;min-width:0;position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;background:#f5f5f3;padding:0}.tile.selected{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:1px}.tile.filled{background:#fff}.tile b{position:absolute;bottom:3px;right:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:400}.keycode .exact{background:#d8eee5;color:#185e46;border-color:#aad0bd}.keycode .present{background:#f7e5b4;color:#6c4b0d;border-color:#e0c581}.keycode .absent{background:#e7e7e5;color:#666;border-color:#d5d5d2}.legend{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin:17px 0 25px;font-size:12px}.legend span{display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:center}.legend i{font-style:normal;border-radius:3px;padding:3px}.keyboard-top{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px}.keyboard-top label{font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;white-space:nowrap}.keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:4px}.keycode .note{padding:0;min-width:0;height:65px;background:#fff;font-size:14px;border-bottom-width:3px}.keycode .note.sharp{background:#eeeeed}.range{font-size:11px;color:#73736f;letter-spacing:1px;margin:9px 0 17px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.composer .actions #submit{margin-left:auto}.keycode #status{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;min-height:44px;margin:17px 0 8px;color:#555}.hints{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:13px}.hints button{border:0;padding-left:0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.hints p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin-top:5px}.keycode details{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}.keycode summary{font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}.keycode details p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.keycode #result{border:1px solid #c7d6f3;border-radius:6px;background:#f0f3fc;padding:20px;margin-bottom:22px}.keycode #result h2{margin:0;font-size:22px}.keycode #result p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.keycode textarea{width:100%;height:170px;margin-top:15px}.keycode button:focus-visible,.keycode summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:480px){.title-row h1{font-size:48px}.legend{gap:9px;font-size:11px}.keycode .note{height:53px;font-size:12px}.keys{gap:6px;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr)}.keycode .actions button{font-size:12px;padding:10px}.keyboard-top{font-size:12px}.board{max-width:290px}.keycode .tile{height:49px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.keycode button{transition:background .15s,border-color .15s}}
</style>
